This file records what this repository ships that BrainChip did not write, or
that carries terms of its own, and what the build fetches without shipping.
Every section names the upstream, the version, the paths and the licence, with
the file and line that declares it. `src/deps/VENDORING.md` records where each
imported tree came from and how to upgrade it; this file covers licensing only.

Where a file declares nothing, that is recorded rather than assumed away. This
file reports what the files declare and draws no conclusions beyond that. It is
not legal advice.

