--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream:   the `akida` Python package, https://pypi.org/project/akida/
Version:    2.17.0, asserted by src/deps/akida/engine/cmake/akida-engine.cmake:35
            (AKIDA_VERSION="2.17.0")
Paths:      src/deps/akida/engine/  (90 tracked files; the engine's own test/
            tree is not tracked, see src/deps/VENDORING.md)
Licence:    Apache License, Version 2.0
Copyright:  Copyright 2023 Brainchip, Inc

The statement that covers the library is under the "Licensing" heading of
src/deps/akida/engine/README.md:449-463. Two files carry an Apache-2.0 header
of their own: src/deps/akida/engine/api/akida/hardware_device.h:2 (Copyright
2021 Brainchip Holdings Ltd.) and src/deps/akida/engine/api/akida/ip_version.h:2
